        "level": 1,
        "type": "heading"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "By P. Correspondent "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "·"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " Updated 3 September 2026"
          }
        ],
        "id": "gaiofhihw736cwon",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The committee approved the amendment after a two-year review, adding clarifications rather than new syntax."
          }
        ],
        "id": "37wsqbbjmzfmotcu",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Implementers said the change would have little effect on existing software, because the affected notation was already widely supported."
          }
        ],
        "id": "pqm57d7lzto2eoaa",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "“"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "This is housekeeping, and that is a good thing,"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "”"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": " one working-group member said."
              }
            ],
            "id": "stpozenictycd72l",
            "type": "paragraph"
          }
        ],
        "callout": null,
        "id": "h472ja3ax6pjkbww",
        "type": "blockquote"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "What changes"
          }
        ],
        "id": "arbxwec3xjyrne4f",
        "level": 2,
        "type": "heading"
      },
      {
        "id": "mcabcinvgs2hoyyg",
        "items": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "The end-of-day instant may again be written as "
